              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                8,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3136,
                "end_index": 3247,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "If you are trying to heal a damaged or tired voice, ENT specialists and vocal coaches advise against whispering"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                8,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3249,
                "end_index": 3385,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Instead, they recommend either **absolute vocal silence** (true rest) or speaking in a gentle, well-supported, low-volume \"normal\" voice"
